# VAPOR — Environment variables
#
# This game is fully static and client-side. It does NOT read any environment
# variables at runtime. This file exists only to document that fact and to
# provide a template if you later add an optional feature that needs one.
#
# No secrets are required. Do not commit a populated .env file.

# Optional: site origin used by analytics if you add GA4 later.
# Leave blank in production unless you have a measurement ID.
# VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# Optional: override the default PRNG seed for deterministic CI runs.
# Leave blank to use the date-based default seed.
# VITE_DEFAULT_SEED=12345
